OL,3,GNEWSACall for photos documenting
OL,4,A'everyday moments'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being asked to submit their
OL,7,Fphotographs for a storytelling project
OL,8,Fdocumenting "everyday moments".
OL,10,FThe Together Through the Lens project
OL,11,Fis asking people living and working in
OL,12,FCumbria to send in pictures that would
OL,13,Fbecome part of an online and in-person
OL,14,Fgallery.
OL,16,FRod Ireland from Westmorland and
OL,17,FFurness Council, who is leading the
OL,18,Fproject, said they hoped to create a
OL,19,Fsnapshot of the area in 2026.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
