OL,3,GNEWSACall for photos documenting
OL,4,A'everyday moments'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not a photography competition,
OL,7,Fit's not about taking the best
OL,8,Fpictures, it's about sharing what
OL,9,Fliving in Westmorland and Furness means
OL,10,Fto different people and the stories
OL,11,Fbehind them," he said.
